# Build outputs and harness droppings are not tree files (MANIFEST's R12
# rule). R15 (D70) added this file after the full-suite runs kept rewriting
# ~150 tracked tests/. logs and the release rebuilds churned make-x64/x64
# objects: `git add -A` must never sweep these again.
make-x64/x64/
tests/.*
make-x64/test_adv
tests/multics.peers
